{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35822","headline":"题王处士山居 · 李咸用","name":"题王处士山居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云木沈沈夏亦寒，此中幽隐几经年。\n无多别业供王税，大半生涯在钓船。\n蜀魄呌回芳草色，鹭鸶飞破夕阳烟。\n干戈蝟起能高卧，只个逍遥是谪仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35822.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35822","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}